{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27805","headline":"同乐天中秋夜洛河翫月二首 一 · 裴夷直","name":"同乐天中秋夜洛河翫月二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清洛半秋悬璧月，彩船当夕泛银河。\n苍龙颔底珠皆没，白帝心边镜乍磨。\n海上几时霜雪积，人间此夜管弦多。\n须知天地爲鑪意，尽取黄金铸作波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴夷直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}